<title>UK: CSFB adds 100 mln Sfr to perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB adds 100 mln Sfr to perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 450 million Swiss francs from 350 million Swiss francs, lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT SUISSE FIRST BOSTON, LONDON BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    450 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.375     MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE   SUBORDINATED  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE    23.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A+     DENOMS (K) 5	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR FROM 23.JUL.07, THEN PAYS 3ML +165 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
